  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The electric field direction between two conducting horizontal plates that are in vacuum is upwards.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The distance between the plates is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"D\"></span> and the potential difference between the plates is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S\"></span>.</p>\n<p>An electron is placed half-way between the plates and released.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitude and the direction of the electron’s acceleration?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Magnitude of electron’s acceleration</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of electron’s acceleration</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>A.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g + \\frac{eS}{m_{\\textup{e}}D}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>downwards</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>B.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g - \\frac{eS}{m_{\\textup{e}}D}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>downwards</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>C.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g + \\frac{eS}{m_{\\textup{e}}D}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>upwards</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>D.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g - \\frac{eS}{m_{\\textup{e}}D}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>upwards</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
